{
  "$comment": "The extras of omx-glue's declaration: what its descriptor, omx-glue.descriptor.json, has no word for (docs/declaration-as-descriptor.md). The two are the folder's hand-written files; tools/gen.mjs generates the rest and writes the travels the descriptor's links resolve to. Its parameters are by reference to omx-contract's glue kernel and bind by name to omx-dsp's instance face. Control order, the descriptor's, is append-only.",
  "stem": "omx-glue",
  "kernel": "glue",
  "kernels": [
    "glue"
  ],
  "noun": "bus compressor",
  "url": "https://github.com/FreeMixer/omx-plugins",
  "binding": "instance",
